        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS35U32D-R, 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" Residential Grade Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Residential Satin Stainless Steel Hinge has a removable, stainless steel hinge pin. Because it is made out of stainless steel, it's rust resistant. The Deltana SS35U32D-R comes packaged as a pair (2) hinges; it also includes wood screws for easier installation. This 3-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Door Hinge has square corners and a standard template hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35U.jpg?v=1704354637\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS35U32D-R Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential Grade)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35U32D-R.pdf?v=1704262240\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS35U32D-R Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
